From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] journal: marshal datastore query types explicitly

dbus-python on Python 3.14 needs explicit signatures for nested datastore
query values. Marshal the Journal query dictionary and property array before
calling the service.

--- a/src/jarabe/journal/model.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/journal/model.py
@@ -224,3 +224,9 @@
     def find(self, query):
-        entries, total_count = _call_datastore('find', query, PROPERTIES,
-                                               byte_arrays=True)
+        marshaled = dbus.Dictionary({}, signature='sv')
+        for key, value in query.items():
+            if isinstance(value, list):
+                value = dbus.Array(value, signature='s')
+            marshaled[key] = value
+        entries, total_count = _call_datastore(
+            'find', marshaled, dbus.Array(PROPERTIES, signature='s'),
+            byte_arrays=True)
